        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-29T07:59:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm hoping they final some spare unused card spots on the printing slab and decide to give us 1 final promo card to mark the end of the kick starter. A wildly successful kick starter. The final kick starter in the multiverse.</p><p>A celebration.</p>",
