        "id": 43047,
        "name": "Tarao",
        "username": "Tarao",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/c57346/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-29T08:57:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would love to see extra stuff at the end to celebrate and all, but thinking about it, but I´m pretty sure they are already losing money with the lowest pledges. I mean, if you take into account what are taking home the people who pledged 20$ or 30$... plus the shipping cost... Luckily for them the average pledge is almost 90$, but I don´t think we can ask for more. In fact I thought that the 175K stretch was going to be just for vengeance backers, but they are giving it away to everybody. Great kickstarter!&nbsp;</p>",
