      {
        "id": 43053,
        "name": "EvanDan55",
        "username": "EvanDan55",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-29T16:09:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Good strong finish at $185k! A good, solid end number! I'd be neat to have another promo card, but I can't see that happening. I'm pretty sure they've filled up every single empty space they've got. I mean, we're getting, what, NINE hero promo cards? They've got every space filled. I'd just like reassurance that all of those promo cards can easily be extracted from the plastic wrap they come in. When I got the promos from IR, the plastic was so tight, I was afraid I'd damage the cards! And promo cards can't be replaced!</p>",
