        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/{size}/2397_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-29T16:24:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"evandan55\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/48/2374_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> evandan55:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'd just like reassurance that all of those promo cards can easily be extracted from the plastic wrap they come in. When I got the promos from IR, the plastic was so tight, I was afraid I'd damage the cards! And promo cards can't be replaced!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'd like to extend that to the cards in general, but yeah the narrow depth on the promo stacks were particularly difficult last time.</p>",
