        "created_at": "2012-11-29T16:29:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Vyolynce\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/48/2397_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Vyolynce:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'd like to extend that to the cards in general, but yeah the narrow depth on the promo stacks were particularly difficult last time.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah I'm not really worried about the bigger decks we'll be getting from ST and the mini-expansions. Except maybe the two environments, if they are packaged separately, since 15 cards is still a pretty small deck and the wrap might be too tight.</p>",
